  "ingredients": [
    "1.333 cups water",
    "0.66666668653488 cup uncooked short-grain white rice",
    "3 tablespoons rice vinegar",
    "3 tablespoons white sugar",
    "1.5 teaspoons salt",
    "4 sheets nori seaweed sheets",
    "0.5 pound imitation crabmeat, flaked",
    "1 avocado - peeled, pitted, and sliced",
    "0.5 cucumber, peeled, cut into small strips",
    "2 tablespoons pickled ginger"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MbeURajPx7jVbM_E2BC-jEjSVMw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24228-Sushi-roll-step1-4x3-2861-c90162d4da2248a7b9c3002f396c085d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24228/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring water to a boil in a medium pot; stir in rice. Reduce heat to medium-low, cover, and simmer until rice is tender and water has been absorbed, 20 to 25 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix rice vinegar, sugar, and salt in a small bowl. Gently stir into cooked rice in the pot and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wnqkejoifz_gMpkIk7V3pU0bIMY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24228-Sushi-roll-step2-4x3-2869-142a6ea0c34f47db8f5c6f2fdd720d42.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24228/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lay nori sheets on a baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FAK-NBOx_0K519YCOmtg4WM6sDA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24228-Sushi-roll-step3-4x3-2878-02b8583ae16a4bddae806a3079796ace.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24228/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat nori in the preheated oven until warm, 1 to 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Center 1 nori sheet on a bamboo sushi mat. Use wet hands to spread a thin layer of rice on top. Arrange 1/4 of the crabmeat, avocado, cucumber, and pickled ginger over rice in a line down the center.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7QG_d5CES32Gc3XjoEUGlGcZ5aI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24228-Sushi-roll-step4-4x3-2886-8b09a71b7edc414c8f1fcabd99c6f7ff.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24228/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lift one end of the mat and roll it tightly over filling to make a complete roll. Repeat with remaining ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mLVL820rBZjVWWsrrj6UZhtnnsg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24228-Sushi-roll-step5a-4x3-2892-d5162eb19cc347bc844226eed1f160f0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24228/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a wet, sharp knife to cut each roll into 4 to 6 slices.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CWIgPBS09srHqLHoNMYsCMCpdgU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24228-Sushi-roll-step6a-4x3-2898-4046116b9a16456b9712eacb21ee7066.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24228/step_08.webp"
    }
